<title>USA: American White Cross nasal dilators OK'd.</title>
<headline>American White Cross nasal dilators OK'd.</headline>
<dateline>DAYVILLE, Conn. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>American White Cross Inc said Monday it received U.S. Food and Drug Administration approval to market its new line of external nasal dilators.</p>
<p>The nasal dilators, which will be marketed under the AirMax and Silent Nite brand names, are intended to enhance breathing capacity during exercise and reduce snoring through enhanced air flow, the company said.</p>
<p>American White Cross manufacturers health and personal care products including adhesive bandages, cotton swabs, cosmetic cotton products and first aid kits.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
